dsh-seat
Copyright 2026 Peter Amiri

This product includes software developed as part of the dsh-seat project
(https://github.com/bpamiri/dsh-seat).

dsh-seat is an independent seat runner for the DeepSeek Harness. It talks to
`dsh` over its published command line and the Agent Client Protocol, and to
OpenRig over its published CLI and HTTP API. It contains no code from either
project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the OpenRig
project or DeepSeek.
